Task families adapted from SlopCodeBench:
  SlopCodeBench problem repository, commit 9cd9ca3a51c3d3e2a99d2488a25baf73a2204451,
  https://github.com/gabeorlanski/scb-problems, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
